WeakCore/extras: standalone files not built as part of the WeakCore library.

These are the non-library files of the WeakCore development: the run-only demo and benchmark
files, the probes, the premise guard (tools/premises) and the check script check-promises.sh.
Every Lean file is stored as `.lean.txt` so that lake does not glob or build it as part of
the library; its `import` lines name the `WeakCore.*` modules.

